WEBVTT

00:00.614 --> 00:02.241
I'll be your opponent!

00:02.949 --> 00:04.610
That's impressive.

00:09.055 --> 00:11.216
I'm so sorry, everyone.

00:11.291 --> 00:15.159
Let me use my power and...

00:16.396 --> 00:17.658
No! Ruri!

00:25.238 --> 00:27.365
All right!
How about another match?!

00:27.541 --> 00:30.203
How can some
surface dweller be able to...

00:34.648 --> 00:39.108
Keep a good eye on the
Maiden until we meet again!

00:58.872 --> 01:02.706
Seki, you don't look too pleased.

01:03.076 --> 01:04.509
Teil Ashford...

01:05.278 --> 01:07.212
I can't blame you.

01:07.280 --> 01:10.306
The Maiden of Life holds the key
to the Company's plans...

01:10.383 --> 01:13.181
...and you let her escape.

01:13.253 --> 01:17.656
I'm sure our leader is
very disappointed as well.

01:18.725 --> 01:21.250
Did you come here...

01:21.528 --> 01:23.086
...just to tell me that?

01:24.130 --> 01:27.691
I understand that
a surface dweller beat you.

01:29.235 --> 01:33.365
I heard that the boy acquired
the power of wind...

01:33.440 --> 01:36.409
...after rising with the
Maiden's power of resurrection.

01:37.310 --> 01:38.743
Snooping around, huh?

01:39.346 --> 01:41.405
Not a very good hobby.

01:42.716 --> 01:45.583
Unlike you,
I'm not interested in...

01:45.652 --> 01:48.382
...tediously watching
events unfold.

01:51.791 --> 01:54.123
I've made my preparations.

02:03.570 --> 02:08.337
The abandoned subway line
leads into darkness.

02:08.608 --> 02:11.941
At the end of this long,
long tunnel...

02:12.012 --> 02:15.778
...beneath Tokyo,
this nation's capital...

02:16.716 --> 02:20.516
...there is a forgotten world
that has been sealed off.

02:20.987 --> 02:25.048
The name of this world where
the sun does not shine is...

02:47.547 --> 02:50.812
The city at night is so cold

02:50.884 --> 02:54.650
I feel like I'm going to lose my mind

02:54.721 --> 02:58.248
I wonder if I can keep going

02:58.324 --> 03:00.792
The important thing...

03:00.860 --> 03:03.055
You must tell me

03:03.129 --> 03:04.721
Please

03:05.098 --> 03:09.694
Do people meet only so
they can part one day?

03:09.769 --> 03:14.934
Tell me that's not true

03:15.475 --> 03:19.070
I loved you so much that it hurt

03:19.145 --> 03:22.808
Everything was sparkling all around

03:22.882 --> 03:26.318
There was nothing to be afraid of

03:26.386 --> 03:29.981
I believed in that

03:30.056 --> 03:33.719
That moment when
my passions stirred

03:33.793 --> 03:37.229
To the point where I thought
I would fall apart

03:37.297 --> 03:40.733
I will never forget that moment

03:40.800 --> 03:44.327
I will never say I want to go back

03:44.404 --> 03:50.400
I just want to see you one more time

04:03.523 --> 04:04.090
The Awakening - When the Wind Blows

04:04.090 --> 04:07.594
The Awakening - When the Wind Blows
The Awakening - When the Wind Blows.

04:07.594 --> 04:10.791
The Awakening - When the Wind Blows

04:12.799 --> 04:14.534
Rumina!

04:14.534 --> 04:14.768
Asagi Style Martial Arts Master
Rumina!

04:14.768 --> 04:15.101
Asagi Style Martial Arts Master

04:15.101 --> 04:17.137
Asagi Style Martial Arts Master
Rumina!

04:17.137 --> 04:17.364
Rumina!

04:18.438 --> 04:20.565
Is he still sleeping?

04:22.075 --> 04:23.770
Don't open it, Ginnosuke!

04:28.481 --> 04:29.914
Sorry!

04:33.286 --> 04:34.719
Hey! Over here!

04:38.525 --> 04:39.719
Wh-What is this?

04:39.793 --> 04:42.853
I don't imagine those guys
are going to give up.

04:43.396 --> 04:46.024
We've got to be prepared.

04:53.907 --> 04:57.604
It doesn't help if you get caught
in your own trap.

05:01.414 --> 05:03.974
That girl didn't wake up yet?

05:04.717 --> 05:05.513
Yeah.

05:05.819 --> 05:09.619
The power of resurrection
must take a lot out of her.

05:11.825 --> 05:14.089
She's been asleep for 3 days now.

05:23.970 --> 05:27.804
I think it would be better
to find another place to hide.

05:28.141 --> 05:30.837
But we can't move her
when she's so weak.

05:31.044 --> 05:33.842
Maybe we should call the police.

05:33.913 --> 05:37.747
You think they'll believe us?
This crazy story?

05:37.951 --> 05:40.112
Even I don't believe it.

05:42.622 --> 05:43.884
Besides...

05:45.859 --> 05:48.350
I'm begging you to help us.

05:55.501 --> 05:57.332
Hey! Slacking off again?!

05:57.971 --> 06:00.633
I was just taking a little break.

06:00.707 --> 06:03.767
There's no time to take
breaks!

06:03.843 --> 06:05.606
Come on!
Get back to your training!

06:06.212 --> 06:07.645
What training?

06:17.023 --> 06:19.617
It's about your ability
to concentrate.

06:20.393 --> 06:24.557
Imagine the wind from your sword
cutting through the water.

06:25.064 --> 06:28.693
Take that image and
expand it in your soul.

06:29.168 --> 06:32.899
The wind,
cutting through the water.

06:36.876 --> 06:37.808
I see it!

06:44.183 --> 06:46.481
It didn't work.

06:46.552 --> 06:48.645
Keep trying until it works!

06:48.721 --> 06:53.317
Keep an eye on him,
um, uh...

06:53.393 --> 06:54.690
Boy with glasses!

06:55.161 --> 06:57.095
It's Ginnosuke.

06:57.163 --> 06:59.063
Ginnosuke Isuzu.

06:59.132 --> 07:01.123
It's about time you remembered.

07:02.902 --> 07:05.166
Anyway, I'll leave him with you!

07:05.238 --> 07:06.569
Uh, sure...

07:07.540 --> 07:10.634
He may never be able to
use that power again.

07:10.710 --> 07:13.110
He is a surface dweller, after all.

07:18.017 --> 07:19.678
What should I do?

07:21.521 --> 07:23.113
As long as we stay here...

07:23.189 --> 07:26.647
...the Company
will keep coming after Ruri.

07:28.361 --> 07:29.623
Even as we speak.

07:34.867 --> 07:36.732
The surface world is big.

07:36.869 --> 07:38.530
When Ruri wakes up...

07:38.604 --> 07:41.437
...maybe we can escape to a place
where they'll never find us.

07:44.277 --> 07:45.335
I'm tired.

07:47.180 --> 07:50.843
Come to think of it,
I haven't slept in a while.

08:00.793 --> 08:01.987
Rumina...

08:02.061 --> 08:03.688
Are you all right?

08:05.231 --> 08:06.994
I'm sick of this!
That's enough!

08:07.834 --> 08:11.770
How could I have the
"power of wind" anyway?

08:11.871 --> 08:14.999
You could control the air's
movement the other day.

08:15.742 --> 08:18.643
The wind was just blowing
strangely at that time.

08:18.711 --> 08:23.512
I'm not like those
underground alien people...

08:23.583 --> 08:26.177
...with strange powers coming
from their hands and feet!

08:26.252 --> 08:27.776
R-Rumina!

08:27.854 --> 08:29.446
Where are you going?!

08:29.655 --> 08:31.418
Getting another wooden sword!

08:34.293 --> 08:35.692
I can't blame him.

08:35.995 --> 08:40.125
How is he supposed to deal with
being told he has a new power?

08:47.173 --> 08:48.470
I see.

08:53.079 --> 08:54.103
Oh, no.

08:54.480 --> 08:55.674
I fell asleep.

09:00.319 --> 09:01.650
Chelsea...

09:09.562 --> 09:12.326
Uh, it's you.
Boy with glasses.

09:14.367 --> 09:16.528
I guess you don't
care to remember.

09:17.870 --> 09:20.464
Knock before you enter!

09:21.007 --> 09:22.235
So? What do you want?

09:22.375 --> 09:25.276
I told you to watch that idiot...

09:27.880 --> 09:31.338
Yeah.
Rumina left a little while ago.

09:33.186 --> 09:35.381
Didn't I tell you to watch him?

09:35.455 --> 09:38.982
I told you to keep an eye on him
so he doesn't goof around!

09:39.058 --> 09:41.253
I tried to stop him.

09:41.461 --> 09:44.760
You didn't stop him
from walking out!

09:44.831 --> 09:46.355
It's okay.

09:46.432 --> 09:48.992
He went out
to buy a wooden sword.

09:49.068 --> 09:52.162
This isn't the time to be shopping!

09:52.238 --> 09:55.298
What if a Company agent comes?!

09:56.175 --> 09:57.870
I don't feel their presence.

10:08.621 --> 10:10.111
Why?

10:21.901 --> 10:22.993
Ruri!

10:24.637 --> 10:25.729
Thank goodness.

10:26.038 --> 10:29.735
I didn't know what I would've
done if you didn't wake up.

10:31.377 --> 10:33.345
Please, Chelsea...

10:35.581 --> 10:37.048
Please.

10:38.117 --> 10:38.981
Chelsea...

10:40.186 --> 10:43.883
Take me to Rumina.

10:45.591 --> 10:48.321
Rumina's in danger.

11:04.810 --> 11:06.539
Please.

11:07.313 --> 11:10.146
Please help us.

11:14.754 --> 11:15.516
Ruri...

11:16.923 --> 11:18.948
I want to protect her, too.

11:20.126 --> 11:22.754
But how am I supposed to
do that?

11:23.996 --> 11:25.361
Damn!

11:25.431 --> 11:28.559
How am I supposed to
use the power of wind?!

11:32.538 --> 11:34.369
You seem to have time
on your hands.

11:34.840 --> 11:36.364
Mister...

11:40.513 --> 11:43.243
Do you want me to play with you?

11:59.065 --> 12:01.260
You seem to have time
on your hands.

12:03.903 --> 12:05.370
Did I imagine that?

12:05.671 --> 12:08.572
There was an electrical field
around her body.

12:08.641 --> 12:11.508
Come on.
Let's play, Mister.

12:12.011 --> 12:14.206
What a creepy kid.

12:17.450 --> 12:20.317
Unfortunately,
I'm not as free as you think.

12:20.753 --> 12:22.015
Go somewhere else.

12:24.123 --> 12:25.454
Then...

12:25.691 --> 12:28.660
Maybe I'll go see the Maiden.

12:33.399 --> 12:36.334
Come on.
Are we going to play or not?

12:40.406 --> 12:41.566
Ruri's in danger!

12:46.512 --> 12:49.140
You can't leave this playground.

12:49.482 --> 12:50.779
Why, you!

12:53.419 --> 12:56.718
I am Shiel,
Master of Thunder.

12:56.789 --> 13:01.226
Tanaka Martial Arts Supplies

13:02.795 --> 13:04.786
They say he left a while ago!

13:04.930 --> 13:06.090
That idiot!

13:06.165 --> 13:08.360
Where did he wander off to?!

13:29.255 --> 13:32.224
It's no fun if you
keep running away.

13:36.195 --> 13:39.858
I have no interest in playing
hide and seek, or tag.

13:45.805 --> 13:49.104
I want to see the power
of wind that you used...

13:49.175 --> 13:50.335
...to beat Seki with.

13:51.610 --> 13:55.740
I want to see a surface dweller
use a special power.

13:56.182 --> 13:58.514
And that power is wind...

13:58.584 --> 14:00.848
...so I'm really interested.

14:01.153 --> 14:03.348
You've got to be kidding!

14:03.689 --> 14:06.089
Are these guys after me now?!

14:06.759 --> 14:09.785
If you force it,
you'll end up getting hurt!

14:13.265 --> 14:14.095
Damn!

14:14.767 --> 14:17.531
If you want to see it that much,
I'll show it to you!

14:17.603 --> 14:19.127
That's it!

14:19.338 --> 14:21.431
You should've agreed
in the first place.

14:26.145 --> 14:27.976
I can't do it.

14:28.447 --> 14:31.280
Don't insult me!

14:33.119 --> 14:34.313
I'm not!

14:36.956 --> 14:37.980
Rumina!

14:38.324 --> 14:39.621
Rumina!

14:44.430 --> 14:45.124
Wait!

14:52.671 --> 14:54.468
The rock stopped in mid-air!

14:54.673 --> 14:57.437
This is the
Thunder Wall Formation!

14:58.411 --> 15:00.379
Thunder Wall Formation?

15:01.013 --> 15:02.640
An electrical barrier.

15:03.015 --> 15:05.506
It's a trick used by those who
hold the power of lightning.

15:05.951 --> 15:07.646
Then that child...

15:08.154 --> 15:09.348
...uses the power of lightning?

15:09.422 --> 15:10.411
Exactly!

15:10.990 --> 15:12.321
I get it!

15:12.391 --> 15:16.953
The Company sent an agent
to check out his new power.

15:17.897 --> 15:22.630
This is also my chance
to see whether his power is real!

15:23.836 --> 15:26.202
You're going to have
to get serious.

15:26.272 --> 15:28.570
Otherwise, you're going to
burn to a crisp!

15:29.308 --> 15:31.435
Thunderclap Fissure
Thunderclap Fissure!

15:31.677 --> 15:32.507
Go!

15:37.650 --> 15:38.776
Rumina!

15:42.321 --> 15:43.515
Rumina!

15:43.589 --> 15:44.419
Ruri?

15:44.990 --> 15:49.552
Hey, the Maiden is awake.

15:49.929 --> 15:51.123
Rumina!

15:51.597 --> 15:52.894
Stay back, Ruri!

15:52.965 --> 15:53.829
It's dangerous!

15:54.400 --> 15:59.201
I don't want to see Rumina
get hurt again because of me!

16:01.173 --> 16:04.506
Once I deal with this guy,
I'll take care of you.

16:05.110 --> 16:07.476
Along with that traitor over there!

16:08.514 --> 16:09.947
Here I go!

16:10.483 --> 16:11.814
My ultimate...

16:11.884 --> 16:13.442
Thunderball
...Thunderball!

16:16.489 --> 16:19.322
There's no way he can survive that!

16:19.391 --> 16:20.358
Rumina!

16:21.093 --> 16:22.685
He sure is a hassle.

16:26.065 --> 16:26.929
Blondie!

16:28.267 --> 16:32.636
I don't want to see Ruri in tears either!

16:33.606 --> 16:34.971
Forget it.

16:35.107 --> 16:39.066
A surface dweller can't cut
through my Thunder Wall.

16:42.414 --> 16:44.848
Well?! How's the taste
of surface garbage?!

16:47.152 --> 16:47.982
Hold it!

16:58.597 --> 17:00.997
The Thunder Wall disappeared.

17:01.066 --> 17:03.500
What's going on, Chelsea?

17:03.736 --> 17:04.600
I get it!

17:05.104 --> 17:09.700
That ribbon is like a switch
that controls her power!

17:11.076 --> 17:12.270
How dare you!

17:12.778 --> 17:15.975
How dare you do that!

17:21.320 --> 17:22.116
Oh, no!

17:22.187 --> 17:25.623
That girl isn't able
to control her own power!

17:26.592 --> 17:27.718
Rumina!

17:28.127 --> 17:28.889
Ruri!

17:29.528 --> 17:30.517
Chelsea!

17:38.804 --> 17:40.533
What an incredible power!

17:48.247 --> 17:49.043
Ruri!

17:49.114 --> 17:50.274
Ruri!

17:50.349 --> 17:52.180
Oh, no!
I didn't make it in time!

17:57.156 --> 17:59.954
It's about your ability
to concentrate.

18:02.861 --> 18:03.793
Please!

18:03.862 --> 18:05.261
Give me the power of wind!

18:06.265 --> 18:10.895
Imagine the wind from your sword
cutting through the water.

18:11.170 --> 18:15.197
And release the power naturally
from deep within your soul.

18:16.208 --> 18:17.732
Wind!

18:30.456 --> 18:31.115
There.

18:31.590 --> 18:32.648
The wind.

18:34.193 --> 18:36.525
Did you get hurt, Ruri?

18:37.529 --> 18:38.553
Uh, no.

18:39.331 --> 18:41.299
But was that Rumina?

18:41.767 --> 18:44.235
Yes.
He has the power of wind.

18:45.270 --> 18:46.032
Wind?

18:46.505 --> 18:47.733
Yes, Wind.

18:48.841 --> 18:51.071
He controls the movement of air.

18:52.411 --> 18:54.470
This is my power?

18:57.182 --> 18:58.945
The power of wind.

19:00.085 --> 19:03.179
To think he has
this much power.

19:04.657 --> 19:06.022
I can't believe it!

19:06.492 --> 19:10.451
How could he blow away
a runaway Thunderball like that?!

19:13.265 --> 19:17.395
Anyway, my job was to confirm
that the surface dweller...

19:17.469 --> 19:19.096
...has a special power.

19:19.304 --> 19:21.101
I don't have any obligation...

19:21.173 --> 19:24.233
...to put myself in further danger
for the sake of the Company.

19:27.780 --> 19:29.372
Rumina!

19:29.715 --> 19:31.683
Thank goodness you're all right!

19:31.817 --> 19:33.842
Don't get all mushy with me!

19:33.919 --> 19:35.978
We were so worried!

19:36.855 --> 19:38.755
When I get serious,
things can really happen!

19:38.824 --> 19:40.291
Rumina!

19:47.232 --> 19:47.994
Ruri.

19:49.034 --> 19:50.365
You're awake now.

19:51.103 --> 19:51.933
Thank goodness.

19:54.673 --> 19:55.435
Yes.

20:01.613 --> 20:05.140
There was one power among
all the elemental powers...

20:05.217 --> 20:08.675
...that those of the Underground...

20:08.754 --> 20:11.120
...were never able
to master properly.

20:12.157 --> 20:14.785
That was the power of wind.

20:15.627 --> 20:17.993
To think that the first
to use that power...

20:18.063 --> 20:19.655
...is a surface dweller.

20:21.266 --> 20:24.565
The next agent to come after us
will not likely come after Ruri...

20:32.478 --> 20:34.070
...but rather,
come after Rumina Asagi.

20:43.722 --> 20:48.421
Again, I walk the streets today

20:48.494 --> 20:54.194
As if I have a purpose

20:54.266 --> 21:07.134
Through a city that looks
polished beyond belief

21:07.746 --> 21:18.418
Are you crying?
Those of you with such tiny pasts

21:18.490 --> 21:30.061
When you look up,
you see the sky on a digital screen

21:30.969 --> 21:39.934
The song of the wind...
I climb up the long staircase

21:40.012 --> 21:43.573
I tried to listen

21:43.649 --> 21:51.749
Hold me
The dream that gently wounded me

21:51.824 --> 22:00.528
Has faded away
Please don't cry

22:10.309 --> 22:12.010
Preview

22:12.010 --> 22:15.446
Blondie, I understand
what you're telling me.

22:15.514 --> 22:18.347
But I want to fulfill Ruri's wishes.

22:18.917 --> 22:20.782
She's been alone all her life.

22:20.853 --> 22:23.651
She just wants to see
where people gather.

22:23.722 --> 22:26.748
That's why I'm taking her
to see my school.

22:27.092 --> 22:28.957
Don't worry! Leave it to me!

22:29.027 --> 22:31.655
I'll protect her
no matter what happens!

22:32.231 --> 22:34.961
Next time on
Tokyo Underground...

22:35.033 --> 22:35.534
..."Full Moon: Ruri's Wish."

22:35.534 --> 22:37.336
Full Moon: Ruri's Wish
..."Full Moon: Ruri's Wish."

22:37.336 --> 22:39.930
Full Moon: Ruri's Wish
